guide forever/horde/40-50/03-feralas
title Feralas, Dustwallow Marsh & Swamp of Sorrows
faction Horde
levels 44-46
zone Feralas
next forever/horde/40-50/04-tanaris
# Route from the Polestar route simulator's Horde consensus (Tauren export),
# visits 39-43, levels 44-45.9. Checked by lint, not play-tested on Forever
# yet. Era + known Forever quests only.
#
# Flow: Stonard (where the previous guide ends; bind) -> A Soggy Scroll ->
# Pool of Tears -> the east coast crawlers -> Misty Reed Post and its
# murlocs -> hearth Stonard -> fly Grom'gol -> zeppelin to Orgrimmar
# (training, turn-ins) -> fly Brackenwall Village -> the Wyrmbog ->
# Brackenwall -> Onyxia's eggs -> Brackenwall -> fly Camp Mojache (bind) ->
# sprite darters, forest walkers, Feral Scar Vale and the hippogryphs ->
# Zorbin Fandazzle and the Forgotten Coast -> the Northspring harpies ->
# hearth Camp Mojache -> Rage Scar yetis -> Camp Mojache, where the next
# guide flies on to Gadgetzan.
#
# Deviations from the export:
# - Threat From the Sea (1426): the export kills part of the murlocs here,
#   the rest on a Blasted Lands pass at 46.7 (visit 45) and hands it in on a
#   return to Misty Reed Post at 47.7 (visit 51) with its follow-up (1427)
#   and Continued Threat (1428). All three are done here in one sweep of the
#   Misty Reed shore and handed in on the spot: both later trips go away.
# - Thunder Bluff (visit 40) is dropped: a flight there and back for one
#   accept, Deadmire (1205), whose turn-in is back in Thunder Bluff near
#   level 50. With it go the Thunder Bluff bind and the hearth back there.
# - Orgrimmar (visit 42) comes straight off the zeppelin instead of after
#   Dustwallow Marsh; Brackenwall then flies on to Camp Mojache. The
#   Orgrimmar bind is left out (the export replaces it at once).
# - Swamp of Sorrows: one loop out of Stonard (scroll, Pool of Tears, the
#   crawlers, Misty Reed) and the export's hearth back to Stonard.
# - Feralas: the four Natural Materials parts are picked up on the way
#   south-west to Feral Scar Vale and the hippogryphs, before Zorbin's coast.
#
# Class training: Orgrimmar. Druids and Paladins: a side flight to Thunder
# Bluff before Dustwallow Marsh.
#
# Optional: Challenge Overlord Mok'Morokk (1173): Mok'Morokk is elite.
# Perfect Yeti Hide (7738): it starts from a rare drop.
#
# Accepted here, finished later on the route: Cortello's Riddle (625, the
# Musty Scroll in Dustwallow Marsh, here), The Atal'ai Exile (1429,
# Hinterlands), Testing the Vessel (3123: Hinterlands owlbeasts, turned in
# at Camp Mojache around 50), Zukk'ash Report (7732, Orgrimmar around 50).
#
# Left out: Deadmire (1205), see above.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Stonard

step Stonard
  zone Swamp of Sorrows
  tip You start in Stonard. Bind here: you hearth back after the coast.
  sethome "Stonard" npc 6930            -- Innkeeper Karakul
  accept 1424                           -- Fel'zerul
  accept 1430                           -- Dar

step A Soggy Scroll
  tip Ride west along the road; the scroll lies at the water's edge in the swamp's far west.
  turnin 624
  accept 625                            -- for the Musty Scroll in Dustwallow Marsh, later in this guide

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Pool of Tears and the coast

step Pool of Tears
  tip Back east past Stonard: the Atal'ai artifacts lie in the water and on the banks of the Pool of Tears.
  collect 6175 quest 1424.1

step Monstrous Crawlers
  tip The Monstrous Crawlers walk the beaches of the east coast, few and far between: kill every one you see on the way south.
  collect 6184 quest 1430.1

step Misty Reed Post
  tip The small Horde post on the southern shore.
  accept 1422                           -- Tok'Kar
  turnin 1422                           -- Katar
  accept 1426

step Murlocs of the Misty Reed
  tip The Marsh Murlocs live on the strand south of the post; the Inkspewers are along the shore east of it and the Flesheaters further west, around the huts on the western shore.
  kill 747 quest 1426.1
  kill 750 quest 1426.2
  kill 751 quest 1426.3

step Misty Reed Post
  turnin 1426                           -- Katar
  accept 1427
  turnin 1427                           -- Tok'Kar
  accept 1428                           -- Katar

step Continued Threat
  tip The same murlocs again, plus the Oracles, who stay near the huts on the western shore.
  kill 750 quest 1428.1
  kill 751 quest 1428.2
  kill 752 quest 1428.3

step Misty Reed Post
  turnin 1428                           -- Katar

step Stonard
  hearth "Stonard"
  turnin 1424                           -- Fel'zerul
  accept 1429                           -- for the Atal'ai Exile in the Hinterlands, around level 48
  turnin 1430                           -- Dar

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Orgrimmar

step Fly to Grom'gol
  fly "Grom'gol"

step Zeppelin to Orgrimmar
  zone Stranglethorn Vale
  tip The zeppelin to Orgrimmar leaves from the tower beside Grom'gol; it lands just north-east of Orgrimmar's main gate.
  goto 31.4,29.9 "Zeppelin tower"

step Orgrimmar
  zone Orgrimmar
  tip Valley of Honor, then the Cleft of Shadow and the Valley of Spirits.
  accept 2981                           -- Belgrom Rockmaul, Valley of Honor
  turnin 2976
  turnin 3121                           -- Neeru Fireblade, Cleft of Shadow
  accept 3122
  turnin 3002                           -- Uthel'nay, Valley of Spirits
  train class only Hunter,Mage,Priest,Rogue,Shaman,Warlock,Warrior

step Thunder Bluff
  only Druid,Paladin
  zone Thunder Bluff
  tip Your trainer is in Thunder Bluff: fly there (no flight path there yet? fly to Camp Taurajo and ride west through Mulgore), then on to Brackenwall Village.
  fly "Thunder Bluff"
  getfp "Thunder Bluff" npc 2995      -- Tal
  train class

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Dustwallow Marsh

step Brackenwall Village
  zone Dustwallow Marsh
  fly "Brackenwall Village"
  accept 1166                           -- Overlord Mok'Morokk
  accept 1168                           -- Tharg
  accept 1169                           -- Draz'Zilb

step The Wyrmbog
  tip Ride south-west to the Musty Scroll, then east through the Wyrmbog. The Firemane scouts and ash tails roam its northern edge with the Searing hatchlings and whelps; the scalebanes guard the dragon caves further south-east. Mok'Morokk's snuff, grog and strongbox lie in the dragonkin camps.
  turnin 625                            -- the Musty Scroll
  collect 5836 quest 1166.3 @36.6,69.6
  collect 5835 quest 1166.2 @38.7,65.6
  kill 4329 quest 1168.1
  kill 4331 quest 1168.2
  collect 5840 quest 1169.1
  collect 5841 quest 1169.2
  collect 5834 quest 1166.1 @44.5,66.0
  kill 4328 quest 1168.3

step Brackenwall Village
  tip Ride back north to Brackenwall.
  turnin 1166                           -- Overlord Mok'Morokk
  turnin 1168                           -- Tharg
  turnin 1169                           -- Draz'Zilb
  accept 1170
  turnin 1170                           -- Overlord Mok'Morokk
  accept 1171
  turnin 1171                           -- Draz'Zilb
  accept 1172

step Onyxia's eggs
  tip The Eggs of Onyxia lie in the dragon caves in the Wyrmbog's south-east, guarded by the scalebanes; smash five.
  goto 53.4,74.7 "Dragon caves"
  complete 1172

step Brackenwall Village
  tip Ride back north to Brackenwall.
  turnin 1172                           -- Draz'Zilb

step Challenge Overlord Mok'Morokk
  tip Overlord Mok'Morokk is elite: grouping up is advised. Beat him down until he gives up, then report to Draz'Zilb.
  accept 1173 optional                  -- Overlord Mok'Morokk
  complete 1173 optional
  turnin 1173 optional                  -- Draz'Zilb

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Camp Mojache

step Camp Mojache
  zone Feralas
  fly "Camp Mojache"
  sethome "Camp Mojache" npc 7737       -- Innkeeper Greul
  turnin 2981                           -- Rok Orhan
  turnin 3122                           -- Witch Doctor Uzer'i
  accept 3123                           -- for the Hinterlands owlbeasts, around level 48
  accept 3128
  accept 2822                           -- Jangdor Swiftstrider
  accept 3063                           -- Talo Thornhoof
  accept 7732                           -- Hadoken Swiftstrider: for Zilzibin Drumlore in Orgrimmar, around level 50

step Sprite darters and forest walkers
  tip The sprite darters flit over the grove just west of the camp and carry the Encrusted Minerals; the Wandering Forest Walkers, a little further west, carry the Splintered Logs.
  collect 9589 quest 3128.2
  goto 60.6,47.4 "Forest walkers"
  collect 9590 quest 3128.1

step Feral Scar Vale
  tip South-west, the yetis den in Feral Scar Vale; every yeti there can drop a thick hide.
  collect 8973 quest 2822.1

step Frayfeather hippogryphs
  tip South of the vale the Frayfeather hippogryphs roost on the slopes; nearly every one drops sinew and metallic fragments.
  collect 9591 quest 3128.3
  collect 9592 quest 3128.4

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- The Forgotten Coast

step Zorbin Fandazzle
  tip Ride north-west to the Forgotten Coast; Zorbin waits on the dock.
  accept 7003
  accept 7721

step The Forgotten Coast
  tip Sea elementals and sea sprays wash along the shore around the dock. Zap the giants with Zorbin's Ultra-Shrinker first: shrunken, they lose their elite strength. Shore striders wade in the water; the land walkers and cliff giants roam the hills further north.
  collect 18958 quest 7721.1
  collect 18956 quest 7003.1

step Zorbin Fandazzle
  turnin 7003
  turnin 7721

step Northspring harpies
  tip The Northspring harpies nest on the ridges in the far north-west. They are 48-50, a few levels above you: the Windcallers heal, so kill them first and pull one at a time.
  kill 5362 quest 3063.1
  kill 5363 quest 3063.2
  kill 5366 quest 3063.4
  kill 5364 quest 3063.3

step Camp Mojache
  hearth "Camp Mojache"
  turnin 2822                           -- Jangdor Swiftstrider
  accept 7734
  turnin 3128                           -- Witch Doctor Uzer'i
  turnin 3063                           -- Talo Thornhoof

step Rage Scar yetis
  tip North-west along the road, the Rage Scar yetis live around the caves in the hills. Any of them can also drop a Perfect Yeti Hide, which starts a quest of its own.
  collect 18947 quest 7734.1
  collect 18972 optional                -- Perfect Yeti Hide, a rare drop
  accept 7738 optional

step Camp Mojache
  tip Ride back east to the camp. Stay here: the next guide starts with the flight to Gadgetzan.
  turnin 7734                           -- Jangdor Swiftstrider
  turnin 7738 optional
